          "ruleId": "LOL-CAP",
          "level": "preferred",
          "summary": "Add a mutual monetary cap with express carve-outs",
          "comment": "[Playbook] Section 15 excludes indirect damages but sets no monetary cap, so direct-damages exposure is unlimited for both parties. We have added our standard mutual cap of the greater of 12 months' fees and USD 1,000,000, and kept the indemnity, confidentiality, gross negligence, wilful misconduct, fraud and IP-infringement claims outside the cap.",
          "ops": [
            {
              "kind": "replace",
              "paragraphId": "p0105",
              "oldText": "The limitation of liability in this Section 15 shall not apply to breaches of Sections 13 and 14.",
              "newText": "Except for Excluded Claims, each party's total aggregate liability arising out of or relating to this Agreement shall not exceed the greater of (a) the fees paid or payable by Sparkling under this Agreement in the twelve (12) months immediately preceding the event giving rise to the claim and (b) USD 1,000,000. The limitation of liability in this Section 15 shall not apply to Excluded Claims, meaning a party's breach of Sections 13 or 14, its indemnification obligations, its gross negligence, wilful misconduct or fraud, and its infringement of the other party's intellectual property rights. Sparkling's obligation to pay fees due under this Agreement shall not be treated as damages for the purposes of this Section 15."
            }
          ]
        },
        "caller": {
          "type": "direct"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "tool_use",
        "id": "toolu_01HnBLjUxAze2intSaQASQdq",
        "name": "propose_redline",
        "input": {
          "ruleId": "NOSOLICIT",
          "level": "fallback",
          "summary": "Convert the mutual no-hire into a narrow 12-month non-solicit with carve-outs",
          "comment": "[Playbook] We cannot accept a no-hire covering all of the other party's employees. We have narrowed Section 19 to a mutual non-solicitation of personnel directly involved in the services, for 12 months from the end of their involvement, with the usual carve-outs for general advertising and unsolicited approaches.",
          "ops": [
            {
              "kind": "replace",
              "paragraphId": "p0133",
              "oldText": "During the term of this Agreement and for a period of one year thereafter, both parties agree not to hire or allow its respective affiliates to hire any employee of the other party, or any person who was an employee of the other party during the previous six months and who was directly involved in the provision of services under this Agreement.",
              "newText": "During the term of this Agreement and for a period of one year after the end of an individual's involvement in the provision of services under this Agreement, neither party shall actively solicit for employment any employee of the other party who was directly involved in the provision of services under this Agreement. This Section does not restrict either party from hiring any person, and does not apply to general advertisements or other recruitment efforts not specifically directed at the other party's personnel, or to responses to or approaches from any individual made on his or her own initiative."
            }
          ]
        },
        "caller": {
          "type": "direct"
        }
      },
      {
